{"id": "1546327831716565002", "channel_id": "1540383915544543252", "author_id": "196082812539895808", "author_name": "leonartona", "content": "As far as I know about Tawil and the main story (which I just finished chapter 7 in Arc 1 by the time I'm writing this), their interaction would be really rare. If any opportunity arose, Mira would've asked a lot of questions, including if there was a way that she would've prevented from her family's tragic fate from happening in the first place.\n\nWith Hameln, on the other hand, I can see Mira helping him with creating lyrics for his songs if asked, considering she writes poems during her spare time. Though I know their session would be a long one, knowing how much of the perfectionist he is.\n-# For some reason, I can also see Hameln using her Morse Key to create music.\n-# No, I am not basing it on how Joel Sunny made some of the music with Morse Codes, what are you talking about? /sarcasm", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:14:44.463000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1540383915544543252", "mentions": ["780305695392137258"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "🔥", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "reply_to": "1546112569746391130", "thread_title": "Mira (Keeper OC) art thread", "forum_channel_id": "1304022107847659520", "thread_tags": ["1304022193465982986"]}
