{"id": "1546544547486498837", "channel_id": "1540383915544543252", "author_id": "196082812539895808", "author_name": "leonartona", "content": "With kid awakeners in general, the best she could do for them without her social awkwardness and/or selective mutism getting in the way is to just be their listener. \nWhether to vent about someone being mean to them or to talk about their little misadventures in Mythag, she wants to give them an equal opportunity to speak their mind without judgement. Something that she herself wasn't able to have in the past, especially with her family.", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:35:53.529000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1540383915544543252", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:36:30.214000+00:00", "mentions": ["1239976637060350043"], "reply_to": "1546516864350552085", "thread_title": "Mira (Keeper OC) art thread", "forum_channel_id": "1304022107847659520", "thread_tags": ["1304022193465982986"]}
